---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: When the checks run
    accDescr: Every pull request runs the required checks and zizmor, whose analysis the rules of main wait for, and the scanners of what it changes: OSV-Scanner for a lock file, fuzzing for Python code and the link check for a document. The release pull request, which changes only the changelog and the version, runs the required checks and zizmor without the scanners. After a merge, main runs only what keeps a baseline or publishes. Every week, main runs the scanners in full, the secret scan of the whole history, the SBOM and the newest Python and Node.

    pr["Pull request"]
    rpr["Release pull request<br>changelog and version"]
    required["Required checks and analyses<br>tests · lint · docs · CodeQL · zizmor<br>dependency review · secret scan"]
    scanners["Scanners of what it changes<br>lock files: OSV-Scanner<br>Python: fuzzing · documents: links"]
    main["main"]
    baseline["What keeps a baseline or publishes<br>tests with coverage · newest Python and Node<br>CodeQL · zizmor · OSV-Scanner · Scorecard<br>website · release · branch bot"]
    weekly["Scanners in full · fuzzing for 15 minutes<br>secret scan of the whole history<br>SBOM · newest Python and Node"]

    pr --> required
    pr -- "changes what they read" --> scanners
    rpr -- "no scanner" --> required
    required -- "every check passes" --> main
    main -- "after a merge" --> baseline
    main -- "every week" --> weekly

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class pr person
    class rpr bot
    class main done
